    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Berlin Kreuzberg studio founded 2005 by Arne Fehmel, Rasso Hilber, and Korbinian Kainz; current partners Fehmel, Korbinian Kainz, Melek Kainz (strategy), and Ove Numrich (code). Core team of ~8. Registered as GbR (Schlesische Str. 31). Specialises in visual identity, editorial, exhibition graphics, web design and front-end development for cultural and educational clients (Akademie der Kunste, Goethe Institut, Korber-Stiftung). Positioned as transmedia concept studio; long-running (20 yrs) with an interdisciplinary team that does both print and digital execution. Autonomy set to 4: well-established studio with partners who lead full projects independently across concept, design, and build; work is hands-on across disciplines.",
